# NOT ignored, deliberately: data/calibration/ and docs/results/.
# They were ignored as "generated outputs", but they hold the project's only
# measurement record — the E-vs-F validation failure and the breadth-vs-depth
# false-accept data — and that record sat untracked for months, one
# `git clean -fd` from being lost. New runs now show up as untracked so you
# decide what to keep, rather than being dropped silently.

